+## CURSOR SHAKE
+
+```
+<cursorShake>
+  <enabled>no</enabled>
+  <maxScale>4.0</maxScale>
+</cursorShake>
+```
+
+Enlarge the cursor while the pointer is shaken back and forth, and let it
+shrink back to normal size shortly after the movement stops. The cursor grows
+and shrinks smoothly. The enlarged image is made by scaling the biggest bitmap
+of the cursor theme, so very large sizes may look soft. Cursor images drawn
+by the client itself, such as those of some X11 clients, are not enlarged.
+
+*<cursorShake><enabled>* [yes|no]
+	Whether to enlarge the cursor when the pointer is shaken. Default is no.
+	When enabled, the cursor theme is loaded a second time at startup,
+	which uses some additional memory.
+
+*<cursorShake><maxScale>*
+	Largest size of the cursor, as a multiple of its normal size. Minimum
+	is 1.0 and values above 20.0 are treated as 20.0. Default is 4.0.
+
 ## ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
 
 *XCURSOR_PATH*
